= Neural Firewall =

{{Plain_Hook
| in_one_sentence    = The Neural Firewall is a software/hardware defense system that protects the [[Neural Network Hardware]] mesh and [[PsiLink]] communications against electronic and psionic attack via four protection layers — cryptographic signal authentication, adaptive noise filtering, node isolation on compromise detection, and physical hardening — operating at the data/signal layer rather than the field/energy layer ([[Defense Discs]] handle field-level threats).
| everyday_analogy   = A combination of TEMPEST hardening + network segmentation + intrusion-detection firewall, but for the psionic mesh. Just as a corporate IT firewall does multiple jobs — authenticates connections, filters malicious traffic, isolates compromised endpoints, and runs on physically hardened hardware — the Neural Firewall does all four for [[PsiSys]]. Each [[PsiLink]] transmission carries a cryptographic signature (so spoofed signals are rejected); adaptive filters strip [[Psi Jammer]] noise from genuine signals (like noise-cancelling headphones); if a node gets compromised ([[Neural Scrambler]] hit), the firewall isolates it so the cascade doesn't spread; and the underlying hardware is EMP-hardened so it survives [[EMP Pulse Blaster]]-class threats. The four layers reinforce each other: an attacker has to defeat ALL of them to penetrate the mesh.
| what_it_predicts   = (1) Layer 1 — cryptographic authentication of every PsiLink transmission, rejecting any signal that doesn't match a known mesh-member signature; (2) Layer 2 — adaptive noise filtering with real-time jammer-noise characterisation and subtraction: Ŝ(t) = R(t) − N̂(t), where N̂(t) ≈ N_jammer(t); (3) Layer 3 — compromised-node isolation analogous to network segmentation, prevents cascading failure through [[Neural Network Hardware]]; (4) Layer 4 — physical hardening (TEMPEST-class shielding, EMP hardening) of the underlying hardware; (5) Defends against [[Psi Jammer]], digital psi attacks, [[Neural Scrambler]]; (6) Real-world parallels: TEMPEST emanation suppression, EMP hardening, network security firewalls.
| if_you_remember_one_thing = The Neural Firewall is the DATA-LAYER complement to the FIELD-LAYER defenses. [[Defense Discs]] stop incoming psionic energy; the Neural Firewall stops malicious or corrupt psionic INFORMATION. You need both — either one alone leaves an open attack surface.
